{
  "note": [
    "The Computer Room's fabric, cut from the one Lawanda layout in scripts/fabric-lawanda.mjs -- regenerate from there, do not hand-edit. COMPUTER-ROOM v2: 17 x 4 x 12, the eye at the middle, the NE corner chamfered along x - z = 12.594 (2.70 m) for the Main Lab branch. Visually dormant: low warm service light, dark silent computer banks as plain dressing on the north wall and the east wall, and ONE glowing red light on the north wall at x 3.1, facing south (LIGHTS). PRINT-OUT is an overlay and is not in the fabric.",
    "North, 1.8 x 2.6 at x -4.0 onto Project Corridor East, seen north-north-west: its floor to its plain west wall 10.5 to 14.2 m out with the whole of its west mouth in the middle, and through that a slice of Project Corridor's floor and the east end of its north wall (PROJECT-CORRIDOR-EAST-MOUTH). West, 2.2 x 2.6 at z -4.0 onto the Projcon Office: its floor to its north wall with the office's north mouth in view, and through it a diagonal slice of Project Corridor to its west wall and west mouth and a sliver of Project Corridor West; the logo and the mural are out of view, so COMPUTER-FIXED does not change this view (PROJCON-OFFICE-MOUTH).",
    "South, 1.7 x 2.5 onto the MINI BOOTH on this room's axis: its short floor and its back wall 10.36 m out, about 1.43 m each side, with the ridged slot and the ten-key keyboard on it (MINI-BOOTH-MOUTH). NE, 2.2 x 2.6 on the chamfer, which stands back to back with the Main Lab's SW chamfer 0.16 m apart -- one short doorway, no passage: the lab's floor to its bare east wall 24.4 to 27.6 m out and the east end of its north wall, with its NE lock door, RAD-DOOR-WEST, in the corner between them, DRAWN SHUT. The Main Lab is an empty placeholder (its package under review): no equipment (MAIN-LAB-BRANCH)."
  ],
